// Feature 09, part 2: a Helm chart in an OCI registry
//
// The helmv3 manager also reads a dependency with an 'oci://' repository.
// For such a dependency, Renovate uses the docker datasource, because an
// OCI registry is a container registry.
//
// The chart podinfo is public on ghcr.io, so this configuration needs no
// host rule. For a private registry, add a host rule with hostType
// 'docker', not 'helm'. The README of this part shows one.
{
  $schema: 'https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json',

  extends: ['config:recommended'],

  labels: ['dependencies'],
}
